> One thing to note—it could be that you are getting these results because participants have a decision in mind before the stimuli are presented. Since you are using the LBA for a value-based task (rather than a perceptual decision task), it is possible that some processing is going on before the stimuli are presented, which would make it difficult to identify the non-decision time.
